  "title": "Fence-post pumpkin",
  "website": {
    "description": "Solar jack-o’-lantern for a fence post. A steel disc inside sticks to a magnet on the fence, so you can swap in light-up decorations for each holiday without fixing anything permanently.",
    "default_view": "assembled",
    "view_labels": {
      "assembled": "Together",
      "exploded": "Exploded",
      "fence-pumpkin-body": "Body",
      "fence-pumpkin-door": "Door",
      "fence-pumpkin-stem": "Stem",
      "fence-pumpkin-door-fix": "Door fix"
    },
    "instructions": [
      {
        "title": "Which files",
        "text": "New pumpkin: print the body, door, and stem. Already printed a body? Print only the door fix."
      },
      {
        "title": "Steel disc",
        "text": "Pause the print when the disc pocket is complete (disc top at 4.10 mm), drop in the disc, and resume. Check the pause layer in your own slice."
      },
      {
        "title": "Door",
        "text": "Print upright as supplied with 15% grid infill and no supports. Thread the light’s wire through, slide the door down, and push in the cork light."
      }
    ],
    "parts": [
